    </p>
    @{ Html.RenderPartial("~/Views/CommissionStructure/_ExampleTable.cshtml"); }
    <p class="text">
        <i>圖2:</i> 舉例展示如何計算從你所推薦的下線合營夥伴（與他們再推薦的下線合營夥伴）的佣金盈利。
    </p>
    <div class="img-support" style="max-width: 600px; margin: 15px auto;">
        <img class="img-responsive" src="~/www/build/styles/Images/revenue-share-structure/revenue_share_hierarchy-us.png" />
    </div>
    <p class="text">
        您下線合營夥伴的佣金盈利計算:
    </p>
    <div style="padding-left: 30px;">
        <p class="text">
            = [B1+ ((C1 + C2) * 10%)]*10% + [B2 * 10%]
        </p>
        <p class="text">
            = [0 + (50,000 + 30,000) * 10%)]*10% + [70,000 * 10%]
        </p>
        <p class="text">
            = 7,800 USD
        </p>
    </div>
    <p class="text">
        <strong>=></strong> 您當月佣金盈利為: 58,050 + 7,800 = <strong>65,850 USD</strong>
    </p>
</div>
